{"id":"4c9feb1083d7b4dd","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-single-letter-fixed-trace.md","title":"Rank Recursion for a Single-Letter Fixed Point","display":"df-single-letter-fixed-trace — Rank Recursion for a Single-Letter Fixed Point","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-single-letter-fixed-trace","aliases":["89-df-single-letter-fixed-trace"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"df-single-letter-fixed-trace — Rank Recursion for a Single-Letter Fixed Point","depends_on":["[[89-df-modalized]]","[[89-df-modal-subformula]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-single-letter-fixed-trace"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-single-letter-fixed-trace</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"df-single-letter-fixed-trace — Rank Recursion for a Single-Letter Fixed Point"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"138d8c34e0370a6b\" href=\"?note=138d8c34e0370a6b\" title=\"89-df-modalized\">89-df-modalized</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"71b4f56d6213ff7c\" href=\"?note=71b4f56d6213ff7c\" title=\"89-df-modal-subformula\">89-df-modal-subformula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(A)\\subseteq\\{p\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(A)\\subseteq\\{p\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Modalized}(A,p)\">\\(\\mathrm{Modalized}(A,p)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_p\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}:\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(B)\\subseteq\\{p\\}\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_p\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}:\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(B)\\subseteq\\{p\\}\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_p\">\\(B,C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_p\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\omega\">\\(k\\in\\omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\{0,1\\}\">\\(b\\in\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ev}_A,t_A,\\mathrm{tr}_A\">\\(\\mathrm{ev}_A,t_A,\\mathrm{tr}_A\\)</span> 是下面定义的当前秩求值、双递归真值和 A-迹；空积为 1。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}single\\text{-}letter\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}trace}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ev}_A(k,\\bot,b)&amp;\\coloneqq0,&amp;\\mathrm{ev}_A(k,p,b)&amp;\\coloneqq b,\\\\\n\\mathrm{ev}_A(k,\\neg B,b)&amp;\\coloneqq1-\\mathrm{ev}_A(k,B,b),&amp;\n\\mathrm{ev}_A(k,B\\land C,b)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{ev}_A(k,B,b)\\mathrm{ev}_A(k,C,b),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ev}_A(k,\\Box B,b)&amp;\\coloneqq\\prod_{j&lt;k}t_A(B,j),\\\\\nt_A(B,k)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{ev}_A(k,B,\\mathrm{ev}_A(k,A,0)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{tr}_A(B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{k\\in\\omega:t_A(B,k)=1\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}single\\text{-}letter\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}trace}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ev}_A(k,\\bot,b)&amp;\\coloneqq0,&amp;\\mathrm{ev}_A(k,p,b)&amp;\\coloneqq b,\\\\\n\\mathrm{ev}_A(k,\\neg B,b)&amp;\\coloneqq1-\\mathrm{ev}_A(k,B,b),&amp;\n\\mathrm{ev}_A(k,B\\land C,b)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{ev}_A(k,B,b)\\mathrm{ev}_A(k,C,b),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ev}_A(k,\\Box B,b)&amp;\\coloneqq\\prod_{j&lt;k}t_A(B,j),\\\\\nt_A(B,k)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{ev}_A(k,B,\\mathrm{ev}_A(k,A,0)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{tr}_A(B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{k\\in\\omega:t_A(B,k)=1\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 108–111；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>先对秩 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 递归，再对当前公式作结构递归；盒子只访问较小秩的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_A\">\\(t_A\\)</span>。因此在给定较低秩全部值后，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ev}_A(k,B,b)\">\\(\\mathrm{ev}_A(k,B,b)\\)</span> 对每个有限公式确定。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 都在盒内，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ev}_A(k,A,b)\">\\(\\mathrm{ev}_A(k,A,b)\\)</span> 不依赖当前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span>；先求它再指定当前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_A(p,k)=t_A(A,k)\">\\(t_A(p,k)=t_A(A,k)\\)</span>。这给存在唯一性，避免直接用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_A(p,k)=t_A(A,k)\">\\(t_A(p,k)=t_A(A,k)\\)</span> 写成未经证明的循环定义。它是原书双归纳 A-trace 的等价形式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modalized","status":"resolved","id":"138d8c34e0370a6b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modalized]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-subformula","status":"resolved","id":"71b4f56d6213ff7c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-subformula]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(A)\\subseteq\\{p\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Modalized}(A,p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_p\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}:\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(B)\\subseteq\\{p\\}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"B,C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_p","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ev}_A,t_A,\\mathrm{tr}_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}single\\text{-}letter\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}trace}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ev}_A(k,\\bot,b)&\\coloneqq0,&\\mathrm{ev}_A(k,p,b)&\\coloneqq b,\\\\\n\\mathrm{ev}_A(k,\\neg B,b)&\\coloneqq1-\\mathrm{ev}_A(k,B,b),&\n\\mathrm{ev}_A(k,B\\land C,b)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{ev}_A(k,B,b)\\mathrm{ev}_A(k,C,b),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ev}_A(k,\\Box B,b)&\\coloneqq\\prod_{j<k}t_A(B,j),\\\\\nt_A(B,k)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{ev}_A(k,B,\\mathrm{ev}_A(k,A,0)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{tr}_A(B)&\\coloneqq\\{k\\in\\omega:t_A(B,k)=1\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"t_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ev}_A(k,B,b)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ev}_A(k,A,b)","display":false},{"tex":"b","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"t_A(p,k)=t_A(A,k)","display":false},{"tex":"t_A(p,k)=t_A(A,k)","display":false}],"bytes":1915,"backlinks":[{"id":"94d543cad7d7ee3b","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8e21aff80559d65a","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5200c72d06d4734b","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-115","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-single-letter-fixed-trace]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-131","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"单字母构造：[[89-df-single-letter-fixed-trace]] → [[89-lem-single-letter-trace-stability]] → [[89-lem-single-letter-trace-semantics]] → [[89-df-single-letter-fixed-algorithm]] → [[89-thm-single-letter-fixed-point]]。"}],"outgoing":["138d8c34e0370a6b","71b4f56d6213ff7c"]}